    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerLine is game where you build and optimize your factory to produce and deliver towers for tower defense games. Accept procedurally generated orders and adapt your factory to fulfill them. Complete more orders to earn rewards, upgrade your machines and logistics, and scale your operation to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use machines like Flatteners and Pressers to shape raw materials into the tower parts you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find elemental sources on the map and infuse your tower parts with fire, magic, or lightning. Orders demand them, and they look cool too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble and deliver fully built towers. Satisfy orders, get your rewards, and grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerLine is game where you build and optimize your factory to produce and deliver towers for tower defense games. Accept procedurally generated orders and adapt your factory to fulfill them. Complete more orders to earn rewards, upgrade your machines and logistics, and scale your operation to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/bf6560e3c3a1a338139fb0ffa3c4db48.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use machines like Flatteners and Pressers to shape raw materials into the tower parts you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/3a6d1bb68841bf7d25250ffabe8ffe7f.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find elemental sources on the map and infuse your tower parts with fire, magic, or lightning. Orders demand them, and they look cool too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.poster.avif?t=1750524450\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.webm?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/ded2a80db00020a995df71e6c3533720.mp4?t=1750524450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble and deliver fully built towers. Satisfy orders, get your rewards, and grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
